{"id":"eca12ccc442387c3f5316ddceda5ba6ebc7ae5a4","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1252114","title":"还要多久，国产 LLM 在性价比和任务表现上能击败 Opus 5.5？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"capgrey","excerpt":"程序员 - @capgrey - 期待这个时刻的到来，同时抵制刷榜行为。顺便问一下，你们看到哪些新的厂商？小米？蚂蚁金服？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>期待这个时刻的到来，同时抵制刷榜行为。</p>\n<p>顺便问一下，你们看到哪些新的厂商？小米？蚂蚁金服？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/国产\"><li></li> 国产</a><a href=\"/tag/LLM\"><li></li> LLM</a><a href=\"/tag/性价比\"><li></li> 性价比</a></P><p><span>18 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-27 20:08:22 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223940\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3e94/2baa/19761_normal.png?m=1735627450\" alt=\"cloudzhou\" data-uid=\"19761\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cloudzhou\">cloudzhou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:34:05 +08:00\">18h 3m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>击败肯定不会很久，半年一年。但是到时候又有 Opus 6.X ，一样不会满足<br>我的观点是，别关心啥 ai 了，自己用，哪个满足你工作就哪个</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224957\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6b3/7360/22839_normal.png?m=1702881883\" alt=\"jimrok\" data-uid=\"22839\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jimrok\">jimrok</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 11:24:05 +08:00\">16h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这东西自己弄需要算力，简单的就是把乐高玩具拆了，自己还原，算力消耗是相当大的。如果你的智能只是看别人还原的视频学到的，多半换一个场景会凉凉。要达到 Opus ，先看算力建设什么时候能跟上。你现在找华为定卡，27 年下半年才能给，卡的量还供不上。不像老美，卡多到堆在仓库里等着电。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225908\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/52e6/5864/442967_normal.png?m=1571234314\" alt=\"PopRain\" data-uid=\"442967\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/PopRain\">PopRain</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 14:15:45 +08:00\">13h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jimrok\">jimrok</a> 早上看新闻，anthropic 招股书说今年(好像）亏损 800 亿美元.... 感觉不可持续，会想法分点卡给中国</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225970\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c2acd7d4430c57e93f3dd4dc6448a42?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jetsung\" data-uid=\"779164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jetsung\">jetsung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 14:22:21 +08:00\">13h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>估计等装机佬买得上内存、显卡的时候吧。前几天看新闻说，5090 显卡进国内后，会被拆了核心，用到算力中心，根本到不了玩家手上。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226148\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/815f/9fae/187268_normal.png?m=1777124300\" alt=\"codehz\" data-uid=\"187268\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/codehz\">codehz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 14:50:33 +08:00\">12h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看啥时候蒸馏技术突破吧，5.5 现在反制蒸馏的手段太狠了，很难稳定提取出思维链<br>与此同时隔壁 astra 倒是有利用服务端压缩的方式提取思维链的方式，所以现在很多模型改蒸 astra 了，说话都有股 gpt 味</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226282\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ed563fb491d74eebf02f624f7e99768?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"poxiaohy\" data-uid=\"25781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/poxiaohy\">poxiaohy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:10:49 +08:00\">12h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>半年前的说的是 Fable 5 ，现在回头看超过或达到 Fable 5 级别的列一列就知道了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226309\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:15:10 +08:00\">12h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉从上个星期开始 Claude 的 opus5.5 的用量萎缩了好多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226318\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f43a82707e213d3b150d36315a450fbb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"alsas\" data-uid=\"162457\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alsas\">alsas</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:16:20 +08:00\">12h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>等突破反蒸馏技术成熟就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226336\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:18:42 +08:00\">12h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最多半年，现在信息量太大了搞得很多人一惊一乍的。opus 4.6 到现在才 8 个半月</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226368\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a0a7da8499cec0f24992d81473febeb9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"z97s04\" data-uid=\"53178\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/z97s04\">z97s04</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:23:28 +08:00\">12h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在反蒸馏技术太厉害了，一时半会跟不上了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n